Priya —

Attaching the gangway hydraulic submittal for compliance review ahead of mock-up load testing.

**P9-GANG hose requirement**
- **Hydraulic hose** assembly per **p9-gang spec**: **SAE 100R2AT** (400 bar working, gangway lift circuit)  
